<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Storage</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>rent
store &lt;item&gt;
unstore &lt;item&gt;
storage
</pre>
<p>In the Storage Office in Udgaard and in Midgaard, a storage clerk will keep 
your things safe for you.
</p>
<ul><li><b>rent</b>: rent storage space in that town, for one platinum piece. You</li></ul>
<pre> only need to do it once in each town.
</pre>
<ul><li><b>store &lt;item&gt;</b>: leave something from your inventory in your storage.</li></ul>
<pre> Containers aren't accepted, and a storage space holds only so much weight.
</pre>
<ul><li><b>storage</b>: see what you have stored there.</li>
<li><b>unstore &lt;item&gt;</b>: take it back. You pay the clerk one gold piece for</li></ul>
<pre> every year (of game time) it was stored, at least one and at most ten.
</pre>
<p>Your storage space in a town only holds what you stored in that town.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Money</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Inventory</a>
</pre>




</div>